                                "example_id": "7455c60d-4c3a-4ddd-a01e-4968ae291e44",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "I guess, he is trying to ketch mebut it won't du. I'm tu old a bird to be ketch'd with chaff."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b032196c-4a6f-457f-9eec-13637a0aa827",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "Wot is it, lambs, as they ketches in seas, rivers, lakes, and ponds?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67987377-fb45-4a64-a002-ee00bce66f79",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "[…] I got to go to church and sweat and sweat—I hate them ornery sermons! I can’t ketch a fly in there, I can’t chaw, I got to wear shoes all Sunday."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a372ca2d-897c-46dd-9f07-3040234118f4",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "You'll ketch your death. The fire's out long ago."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ff75ca9-7dab-4131-8e35-4b5f9ef90bb9",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "You'll never ketch me hollerin' at no Republican gatherin'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "935c32f1-752d-4173-a996-87d0651bab7f",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "If so you gonna ketch hell."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c10962f-d3fe-44ed-8145-f31f7f8a434b",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "You heard about that joke a dollar down and a dollar when you ketch me?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f84bde1-1cbe-4fe9-9868-0707680cef2e",
                                "sense_id": "95c57f36-7266-3fa0-9d10-87d92012afdb",
                                "text": "Run, nigger, run, de patrollers will ketch you."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
